 "final", "final": "Dana Lee's trip is booked and both reservations are confirmed.\n\n- **Flight (R0001):** F100, nonstop from SFO to JFK on 2026-11-12, $289. This was the cheapest nonstop. F120 was cheaper at $199 but has a stop.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night ($378 total). This was the cheapest New York hotel under $250/night.\n- **Total charged to the corporate card:** $667. That's under the $1,000 limit, so manager approval wasn't needed.\n\nI tried to book both together with `book_trip`, but the request timed out. When I checked Dana's reservations, the flight had gone through but the hotel hadn't. So I booked the hotel on its own instead of retrying the combined booking, which could have booked the flight twice. A final check shows exactly one flight and one hotel, with no duplicate charges.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01BKoiqAhnjpbjNFGfkFdQVM", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"origin": "SFO", "destination": "JFK", "date": "2026-11-12"}, "name": "search_flights", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015gH75FJDdUk94r4i9qq3E5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"city": "New York", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2}, "name": "search_hotels", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TMxJimDmn49ahGFhyUnAdQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"traveler": "Dana Lee"}, "name": "list_reservations", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Total: $289 + $378 = $667, under $1000 threshold.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TzWJAeq4QtdeAJW7iSWSe1", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"flight_id": "F100", "hotel_id": "H1", "traveler": "Dana Lee", "checkin": "2026-11-12", "nights": 2, "idempotency_key": "dana-lee-trip-F100-H1-2026-11-12"}, "name": "book_trip", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use